1
00:00:00,060 --> 00:00:03,916
Myth or fact? If profit is up, the bank will lend.

2
00:00:04,036 --> 00:00:06,862
Profit's up twenty percent. The bank should be easy.

3
00:00:06,982 --> 00:00:10,095
Banks are repaid from cash, not profit.

4
00:00:10,215 --> 00:00:11,875
Isn't that the same thing?

5
00:00:11,995 --> 00:00:15,542
Not when customers take ninety days to pay.

6
00:00:15,662 --> 00:00:17,811
In our view, that's a myth.

7
00:00:17,931 --> 00:00:23,452
Banks look at the cash that repays the loan, and how well it covers each payment.

8
00:00:23,572 --> 00:00:27,768
Our banking & financing advisory prepares this with you.

9
00:00:27,888 --> 00:00:32,238
Facility review coming up? Talk to us first.
